{
  "manifest_version": 1,
  "type": "device",
  "name": "Legrand In One CPL",
  "description": {
    "en": "Control Legrand In One (PLC) lights through the 882 13 USB serial interface",
    "fr": "Pilotez vos éclairages Legrand In One (CPL) via l'interface USB série 882 13"
  },
  "version": "0.4.0",
  "docker_image": "ghcr.io/xdeco/gladys-integration-legrand-inone:0.4.0",
  "gladys_version": ">=4.86.0",
  "categories": [
    "lighting"
  ],
  "cover_image": "https://raw.githubusercontent.com/XDECO/gladys-integration-legrand-inone/main/cover.png",
  "config_schema": [
    {
      "key": "host",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Serial gateway address",
        "fr": "Adresse de la passerelle série"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "172.17.0.1",
        "fr": "172.17.0.1"
      },
      "default": "172.17.0.1",
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "port",
      "type": "number",
      "label": {
        "en": "Serial gateway TCP port",
        "fr": "Port TCP de la passerelle série"
      },
      "default": 2000,
      "min": 1,
      "max": 65535,
      "required": true
    },
    {
      "key": "links_help",
      "type": "section",
      "label": {
        "en": "Linked devices",
        "fr": "Appareils liés"
      },
      "description": {
        "en": "The bus never reports the state of a receiver. Each rule below tells which lights follow a button, in Gladys only (nothing is sent on the bus). Use the circuit numbers printed in the logs. A light on the left: the lights on the right copy its state, e.g. 648966-1 -> 944559-1, 944559-2. A scenario button on the left: give each light its state, e.g. 648966-3 -> 944559-1=off, 944559-2=off. More than 12 rules? Put several in one field, separated by ;",
        "fr": "Le bus ne dit jamais l'état d'un récepteur. Chaque règle ci-dessous indique quelles lumières suivent un bouton, dans Gladys uniquement (rien n'est envoyé sur le bus). Utilisez les numéros de circuit affichés dans les journaux. Une lumière à gauche : les lumières de droite copient son état, ex. 648966-1 -> 944559-1, 944559-2. Un bouton de scène à gauche : donnez l'état de chaque lumière, ex. 648966-3 -> 944559-1=off, 944559-2=off. Plus de 12 règles ? Mettez-en plusieurs dans un champ, séparées par ;"
      }
    },
    {
      "key": "link_1",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rule 1",
        "fr": "Règle 1"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "648966-1 -> 944559-1, 944559-2",
        "fr": "648966-1 -> 944559-1, 944559-2"
      },
      "default": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "link_2",
      "type": "string",
      "label": {
        "en": "Rule 2",
        "fr": "Règle 2"
      },
      "placeholder": {
        "en": "648966-3 -> 944559-1=off, 944559-2=off",
        "fr": "648966-3 -> 944559-1=off, 944559-2=off"
      },
      "default": ""
    },
    {
